.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-mr-approve \- Approve merge requests.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab mr approve [] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Defaults to the currently checked-out branch.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-s\fP, \fB--sha\fP=""
	SHA, which must match the SHA of the HEAD commit of the merge request.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
glab mr approve 235
glab mr approve 123 345
glab mr approve branch-1
glab mr approve branch-2 branch-3

# Finds open merge request from current branch and approves it
glab mr approve
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-mr(1)\fP
